      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Four novel bisabolane sesquiterpenes, turmerone A (1), turmerone B (2), turmerone C (3), and turmerone D (4), were isolated from the rhizomes of Curcuma longa. Their structures were elucidated on the basis of chemical and spectral analysis, including 1D, 2D NMR analyses and HRESIMS."},
